prologue/asy/life/README

These are the files for the Extra topic on the game of Life.

2021-Jun-02 JH  I have added the out/*.life files to the git repo so
  a person could just use them, without having to generate them.
2024-Aug-06 JH In switch from Chicken scm to Racket, I did some
  rewriting of what is here.  I eliminated the out/directory and
  put in a gameboards/ directory with the same role.

To have the sequence of gameboards be correct, I use a program that
starts with an .init file, such as blinker.init.  The program is
 /computing/src/scheme/prologue/life/life.rkt
More is in that directory.

To generate all the files associated with blinker, run asymptote on
blinker_all.asy.  That, in turn, uses the files gameboard/blinker*.life,
(which are ultimately generated by life.rkt).

